          "heading": "Fiji record one victory in five matches after Japan home defeat",
          "body": "Fiji have secured only one victory in their last five international matches, a period that includes four defeats. This sequence of results includes a 20-15 loss against Japan on home soil during the Pacific Nations Cup knockout stage in September 2026. The side has struggled for consistency during this window, managing just a single win alongside four losses in their recent fixtures. This run of form highlights the team's current difficulty in converting opportunities into winning performances."
