          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Maddie Feaunati returns to England Women's side for New Zealand Test",
          "body": "Maddie Feaunati returns to the back row for England Women this weekend as the team prepares to face New Zealand at Allianz Stadium. Head coach John Mitchell confirmed Feaunati will start at number eight, with Alex Matthews moving to blind-side flanker and Abi Burton rotating to the bench. Following a 26-26 draw against Canada, Mitchell remains optimistic: \"Test matches against the best teams in the world are what we relish and look forward to, especially at Allianz Stadium.\""
