          "heading": "France rugby team record for consecutive weeks at world number one",
          "body": "While France continues to compete at the highest level of the international game, the side’s longest unbroken spell at the top of the world rankings remains one week. This achievement occurred during the month of July in 2022. The national squad now looks to build on their recent form following the victory over Japan as preparations continue for the upcoming fixture against Fiji."
