      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury concern",
          "heading": "Caelan Doris remains Leinster captain but faces November international fitness doubt",
          "body": "Leinster head coach Leo Cullen has confirmed that Caelan Doris will continue as club captain this season, but his availability for Ireland’s upcoming Nations Championship matches remains uncertain. Doris has been sidelined following surgery on a knee injury sustained during the URC final, with his rehabilitation progress currently delayed. Cullen admitted he is \"not 100 per cent sure\" on the timeline for a return, casting doubt on whether the forward will be match-fit for the November Test series against Argentina, Fiji and South Africa."
        },
