          "heading": "Italy Men prepare for Nations Championship clash at Allianz Stadium venue",
          "body": "Gonzalo Quesada’s side will return to Turin in November to face world champions South Africa, marking the team’s first home fixture in the inaugural Nations Championship. The match follows a difficult run in which Italy have conceded 131 points across their opening three matches of the campaign. Across their last 11 outings, the Azzurri have scored 190 points and conceded 318, with their largest victory in that window remaining the 34-19 win against Chile at home in November 2025."
