          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Darcy Graham Ruled Out Of Scotland Autumn Tests With Ruptured Bicep",
          "body": "Scotland and Edinburgh have suffered a major setback after Darcy Graham was ruled out for a minimum of 12 weeks with a ruptured bicep. Edinburgh head coach Sean Everitt confirmed that the winger picked up the injury during a friendly collision against Harlequins, missing the scan results initially before a Monday MRI confirmed the tear. The 29-year-old will miss the upcoming November Tests against New Zealand, Australia and Japan at Murrayfield, alongside the initial part of the club season."
        },
