          "kicker": "WRU Leadership",
          "heading": "Harry Bowcott emerges as frontrunner to become new WRU chair",
          "body": "Former McKinsey senior partner Harry Bowcott has emerged as the frontrunner to become the next chairman of the Welsh Rugby Union following interviews at the Sport Wales office in Cardiff. The 51-year-old Cambridge graduate, whose late grandfather Henry Morgan Bowcott played for Wales and served as WRU president, is competing against former Harlequins chief executive Mark Evans for the independent non-executive role. The successful candidate will oversee the board's plans to reduce Wales' professional teams from four to three."
        },
        {
