      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Tbilisi Win",
          "heading": "Pumas Hammer Iberians As Tino Swanepoel Crosses Five Times",
          "body": "The Pumas recorded an emphatic 64-21 victory over Spain's Iberians in Tbilisi, having established a commanding 40-14 lead at half-time. Left wing Tino Swanepoel was the star of the show, crossing five times as the side ran in 10 tries in total. Clinton Swart, Wian van Niekerk, Gustav du Rand, Alfondso Isaacs and André Fouché also crossed the whitewash, with Swart adding 5 conversions alongside 2 from Bradley Giddy."
        },
        {
          "kicker": "Around the world",
          "heading": "Ireland: Caelan Doris faces November international fitness doubt",
