      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Team news",
          "heading": "Les Kiss names Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii on the wing for Springboks Test",
          "body": "Les Kiss has named Joseph-Aukuso Suaalii to start on the left wing for the first time in his Test career ahead of Sunday's fixture against South Africa in Perth. The code-hopper moves from the centres to the outside backs where his aerial ability can be utilised, with Hunter Paisami returning to partner Len Ikitau in the midfield. Kiss has also changed tack by selecting a 6-2 forward-heavy bench split to match the world champions, having stated: \"We've had a solid preparation window here in Perth ahead of what's going to be a massive Test against South Africa.\""
        },
